# Lava and flame markers protect one surviving decaying rune.
NAME:    swamp_fiery
TAGS:    transparent no_pool_fixup no_rotate
PLACE:   Swamp:$
ORIENT:  float
MONS:    fire dragon, lindwurm / fire crab w:8, swamp dragon / hydra w:12
MONS:    swamp drake / steam dragon w:4
