             size = 2, walk_dist = 1, spread_rate= 3, excl_rad = 0 }
KPROP:   lR = no_cloud_gen
KFEAT:   XR = lava
KITEM:   O = decaying rune of Zot
NSUBST:  O = 1:O / *:l
SUBST:   - = WW.
